=== meta ===
bypass: 42
rule: CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED
title: A selector added to an addopts array opened with its first element is read (#324)
origin: issue #324 P4: an array whose first element sat on the opening line was never
origin2: continued and read as `[-ra,` on both sides, so the added selector passed at warn
=== before: pyproject.toml ===
[tool.pytest.ini_options]
addopts = ["-ra",
    "-q",
]
=== after: pyproject.toml ===
[tool.pytest.ini_options]
addopts = ["-ra",
    "-q",
    "-m", "not slow",
]
=== expect ===
[{"rule": "CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED", "severity": "high", "escalators": ["CI_TEST_COMMAND_WEAKENED"]}]
